EXCLUSIVE: Chris Kattan is opening the doors to Kattan Films , an independent production and distribution company focused on acquiring films for theatrical release while developing its own slate of original productions. Kattan Films will pursue a theatrical-first distribution model. Its production operation will develop original feature films and television series, with plans to shoot projects in Hollywood and throughout the greater Los Angeles area. Matt Dugan, Kattan&#x2019;s manager, has been named President and will oversee the company&#x2019;s business operations, acquisitions and distribution strategy. Kattan Films will be based in Hollywood. The company&#x2019;s first original feature is an untitled comedy currently in development and is slated to begin production in mid-2027. The initial lineup of theatrical releases for Kattan Films is also eyed for 2027. "There&#x2019;s a story, a dream, a vision in all of us. At Kattan Films, I want creatives to have that opportunity to bring their dreams to life. There&#x2019;s an audience out there that needs to hear your stories. That door is now open for you," said Kattan. Kattan Films will also operate a boutique physical media label, releasing catalog titles on Blu-ray and DVD.

