It&#x2019;s difficult to imagine a song choice more precisely capturing the essence of a movie than Boz Scaggs&#x2019; mellow yacht rock groove &#x201C;Lowdown,&#x201D; which kicks off the end credits of The Further Mis-Adventures of Cliff Booth . That might seem odd for a gritty comedy that builds to an ultraviolent climactic bloodbath, but this standalone chapter in the life of the now-retired stuntman from Once Upon a Time in Hollywood &#x2014; the role that won Brad Pitt an Oscar &#x2014; saunters along to its own idiosyncratic beat, running on a well-lubricated R&B engine. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450],[4,4],[300,251]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

The star&#x2019;s golden glow and loose-limbed charisma, David Fincher &#x2019;s exactingly controlled direction and the shaggier storytelling style of Quentin Tarantino &#x2019;s screenplay are not always the most seamless fit. But the obvious mutual esteem and affection shared by that creative triumvirate is contagious and the movie has a good-time vibe that just won&#x2019;t quit &#x2014; even if it feels more stretched and less substantive than its 2019 predecessor. Still, few fans will complain, especially those who opt for the IMAX experience, before it hits Netflix on Dec. 23. Related Stories Movies Ron Howard Wasn't Sure He Was the Right Director for 'Avedon'; This Is What Changed His Mind TV Netflix to Adapt 'Grendel' Comic Books Into Adult Animated TV Series The Further Mis-Adventures of Cliff Booth The Bottom Line Sexy, seductive and chaotic in mostly fun ways. Release date : Weds., Nov. 25 (in theaters); Weds., Dec. 23 (streaming) Cast : Brad Pitt, Elizabeth Debicki, Scott Caan, Carla Gugino, Yahya Abdul-Mateen II, Peter Weller, Matt Groove, JB Tadena, Corey Fogelmanis, Karren Karagulian, Lauren Glazier, Timothy Olyphant, Nicholas Hammond Director : David Fincher Screenwriter : Quentin Tarantino Rated R, 2 hours 23 minutes

Eight years have passed since Cliff and Leonardo DiCaprio&#x2019;s faded TV star Rick Dalton, for whom Pitt&#x2019;s character worked as a longtime stunt double, mopped up three homicidal Manson followers &#x2014; described here as &#x201C;those fuckin&#x2019; hippie intruders&#x201D; &#x2014; in pools of their own blood. Rick is now starring in a TV series in Australia drolly titled Dingo Dan , and Cliff has aged out of the stunt game, though his is not an idle retirement.

He works as a projectionist at the New Beverly Cinema &#x2014; the historic repertory house in the Fairfax district now owned and programmed by Tarantino as a 35mm stronghold &#x2014; where the fictional blaxploitation film Soul Brothers Die Hard has been such a hit that Cliff can recite the dialogue along with the actors. Its cast is topped by former Oakland Raiders player Roderick &#x201C;Hot Rod&#x201D; Harrison ( Yahya Abdul-Mateen II ), who opens Fincher&#x2019;s film with a quintessential Tarantino provocation, enlightening his character&#x2019;s nephew about &#x201C;how to keep multiple bitches turnt out.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[300,250],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450],[4,4]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

Cliff also mixes killer cocktails at a rowdy Redondo Beach tiki bar that features female mud-wrestling contests and picks up occasional work as &#x201C;a day player&#x201D; on XXX porn movies, including one currently in production titled The Sexorcist . For recreation, he participates in punishing demolition derby meets.

